<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<model xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/3dmanufacturing/core/2015/02" unit="millimeter" xml:lang="en-US" xmlns:BambuStudio="http://schemas.bambulab.com/package/2021">
 <metadata name="Application">BambuStudio-02.03.00.70</metadata>
 <metadata name="BambuStudio:3mfVersion">1</metadata>
 <metadata name="Copyright" />
 <metadata name="CreationDate">2025-10-23</metadata>
 <metadata name="Description">&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;Gridfinity Universal Spacers V2&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;These upgraded spacers help you securely organize your &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;Gridfinity baseplate system&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; without the need for screws. They &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;print super fast (~10 minutes)&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; and are &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;more durable&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt; than the previous version. Perfect for keeping your setup firmly in place while adjusting the spacing as needed. &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;Make sure your print bed is clean before printing.&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;Sizes:&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;&amp;lt;ul&amp;gt;&amp;lt;li&amp;gt;&amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;Extra Small (XS): 9–3 mm / 0.35–0.12 in&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/li&amp;gt;&amp;lt;li&amp;gt;&amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;Small (S): 13–8 mm / 0.51–0.31 in&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/li&amp;gt;&amp;lt;li&amp;gt;&amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;Medium (M): 15–12 mm / 0.59–0.47 in&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/li&amp;gt;&amp;lt;li&amp;gt;&amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;Large (L): 25–15 mm / 0.98–0.59 in&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/li&amp;gt;&amp;lt;li&amp;gt;&amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;Extra Large (XL): 40–25 mm / 1.57–0.98 in&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/li&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/ul&amp;gt;&amp;lt;p&amp;gt;Ideal for &amp;lt;strong&amp;gt;adjusting heights, securing pieces, and keeping your Gridfinity setup neat and organized&amp;lt;/strong&amp;gt;.&amp;lt;/p&amp;gt;</metadata>
 <metadata name="Designer">Rebel3D</metadata>
